From: GTOS go-live prep (Wave-7) — STAGED, NOT AUTO-APPLIED
Subject: [STAGED PATCH] Disable the proven-losing broad V4 selector before go-live

WHY
  The native broad Selector V4 is the live loser confirmed by the hard halt:
  -0.25R/fill, -113.4R over 454 fills, negative every month. Go-live is a NARROW
  REPLACEMENT (the clean_3 11-sleeve book through ultimate_book_live_package.py),
  NOT an augmentation of the existing broad selection. This patch turns the broad
